A new minor release of 'secr' is now on CRAN. This adds some features to make.mask() and fixes mostly minor bugs. A new function plotMaskEdge will add a bounding line to a plot of mask cells if you wait long enough. See NEWS <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/secr/NEWS> for a list of changes.
Murray

